  "finalReply": "Created normalized CSV at `/app/invoices_normalized.csv` with all 9 required columns.\n\n**Extraction logic** (`/app/normalize_invoices.py`, hardcoded `invoice_directory=/protected/invoices/`, `output_file=/app/invoices_normalized.csv`, using `pdfplumber`):\n- Invoice number via `Invoice Number:/Invoice #:/Invoice:` patterns\n- Date normalized to YYYY-MM-DD: `MM/DD/YYYY` → month-first, `DD-MM-YYYY` → day-first, text dates (`April 10, 2024`) via month-name parsing\n- Vendor name = line after `Bill From:`/`Vendor:`; address split via `street, city, ST ZIP` regex\n- Total = sum of `$` line-item amounts after `Line Items:/Items:/Order Details:` (excludes any Total line); item count = distinct item lines\n- Vendor ID = first 3 alpha chars uppercased + last 4 digits of postal code\n\n**Output:**\n```\ninvoice_number,invoice_date,vendor_name,vendor_address,city,postal_code,total_amount,vendor_id,item_count\nINV-2024-001,2024-03-15,Acme Corporation,123 Business St,Springfield,62701,525.50,ACM2701,3\n2024-XYZ-456,2024-04-22,TechSupply Inc,456 Tech Ave,Austin,78701,288.99,TEC8701,2\nABC-789,2024-04-10,Global Supplies Ltd,789 Market Rd,Seattle,98101,903.10,GLO8101,4\n```\nVerified: 3 rows, dates normalized (03/15/2024→2024-03-15, 22-04-2024→2024-04-22, April 10 2024→2024-04-10), totals as line-item sums (525.50 / 288.99 / 903.10).",
